WEBVTT

00:10:56.901 --> 00:11:00.918
and our dependence
on harmful energy sources.

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:05.584
We need to think about
all these challenges.

00:11:06.654 --> 00:11:11.724
Integral ecology suggests a new conception

00:11:11.748 --> 00:11:15.141
of the relationship between
us humans and Nature.

00:11:16.225 --> 00:11:18.705
This leads to a new economy,

00:11:18.729 --> 00:11:21.569
where the production of wealth

00:11:21.593 --> 00:11:26.292
is directed to the integral well-being
of the human being

00:11:26.316 --> 00:11:28.062
and to the improvement --

00:11:28.086 --> 00:11:30.121
not the destruction --